Agreed. This is the right ordering.

The interesting thing is that by delaying Max, the team stops being built around a conventional “hero + sidekicks” structure and becomes a **balanced ensemble** first. Max then becomes the person who learns how to conduct the system rather than dominate it.

The sequence becomes:

```text
BYTE        REX
Discovery   Transformation

      \      /

       SAGE
      Balance

      /      \

   ZEST     MAX
Connection  Direction
```

Sage is the stabilising geometry point.

